{{also|Maandag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|manendach}}, {{m|dum|maendach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*mānendag}}, from late {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{m|gem-pro|*mēniniz dagaz||day of the moon}}.

Compare Low German {{m|nds|Maandag}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|moandei}}, German {{m|de|Montag}}, English {{m|en|Monday}}, Danish {{m|da|mandag}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmaːn.dɑx/|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-maandag.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-:en|maandagje}}

# [[Monday]]

